@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Ollama AI Bid Analysis

DEVELOPER OWNER: Tariq
MODULE: Technical & Financial Evaluation Committee
TRELLO TASK: Ollama AI Bid Analysis
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/oWr6Ezhy

PURPOSE:
Request an advisory Ollama analysis of offers (price,
specifications, delivery, missing documents).

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Evaluation Committee member (assigned to the tender)

ROUTE: /EvaluationCommittee/Evaluations/AiAnalysis/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Create an OllamaAnalysisService (local HTTP call) behind
  an interface.
- Send only this tender’s offer data; handle timeouts and an
  unavailable Ollama honestly.
- Decide with the team whether results are stored (would
  need a migration) or generated on demand.

DEPENDENCIES:
Bids, BidItems, Documents (metadata), Ollama (local
service).

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Never display fabricated AI output.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Ollama AI Bid Analysis";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "AI Analysis";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Advisory AI summary of the offers. It never scores, ranks or selects a winner.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Advisory only</strong><p>Ollama may summarize offers and flag strengths, weaknesses and missing documents. It never changes scores, rankings or the award, and its output is never shown to suppliers.</p></aside>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Request analysis</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-offers-to-analyse-1">Offers to analyse</label><select id="f-offers-to-analyse-1"><option>Select eligible offers</option></select></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-focus-2">Focus</label><select id="f-focus-2"><option>Price</option><option>Specifications</option><option>Delivery</option><option>Missing documents</option></select></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Run analysis</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Analysis result</h2>
    <partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No analysis has been generated. The Ollama integration is not implemented."' />
</section>
